{
"file": 410,
"paths": [
"d008/d014/f020"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "eeea2d35",
"en_raw": "Ah!"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "ec873070",
"en_raw": "Sango-chan, look, look!"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "1dd74c55",
"en_raw": "Look, there's the character 'ru'"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "47f7f5e4",
"en_raw": "The 'ru' of Hirumi is..."
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "c9926ff9",
"en_raw": "The middle character is the same as Kurumi's!"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "c0e1f316",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sango-chan,"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "adbaeaa2",
"en_raw": "What does this character mean?"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "8442ba58",
"en_raw": "This?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "ebbbf18c",
"en_raw": "'To stay'..."
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "3506f138",
"en_raw": "Shiina, do you get the meaning?"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "c984f154",
"en_raw": "...Seriously?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "4cde5bdf",
"en_raw": "Even so..."
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "49a02f5e",
"en_raw": "why does only this town's name"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "85e0f3c6",
"en_raw": "have a character like 'ru' in it"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "55b499f9",
"en_raw": "Oh my, you don't know?"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "ba9960c4",
"en_raw": "Hirumi was originally"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "d3ac32cf",
"en_raw": "written like that"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "3a3cc39a",
"en_raw": "Um, excuse me"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "6e8a5fe0",
"en_raw": "What is it?"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "984cac65",
"en_raw": "Originally it was that name..."
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "9ba6675f",
"en_raw": "What do you mean?"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "92a6611e",
"en_raw": "This town, you see, was originally"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "35301a0d",
"en_raw": "To see the evening sun stay..."
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "7ac31697",
"en_raw": "That's why it's written Hirumi"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "8f60f45c",
"en_raw": "It's a beautiful name, isn't it"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "08c6274f",
"en_raw": "The 'ru'~ in Kurumi is"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "17140818",
"en_raw": "this same character!"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "a4cd7ff8",
"en_raw": "Your name is Kurumi?"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "82e1f995",
"en_raw": "What an unusual name"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "07872856",
"en_raw": "Beauty that stays long..."
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "af499054",
"en_raw": "It's a good name"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "8c30e16d",
"en_raw": "It suits you"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "767b0f2f",
"en_raw": "I used to like"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "1747e494",
"en_raw": "I used to like it, but..."
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "ebfa5c3d",
"en_raw": "You know that kind of thing..."
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "17ee8efb",
"en_raw": "Meaning you've lived here a long time?"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "f277ae97",
"en_raw": "Well, since before"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "ac0399d7",
"en_raw": "your mother was born"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "0a1b4276",
"en_raw": "I've been living here"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "94541f87",
"en_raw": "Then, I'd like to ask"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "9b79fd66",
"en_raw": "do you know Hanako-san's grave?"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "4abf747d",
"en_raw": "A grave? Let me think..."
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "6b4b4445",
"en_raw": "Oh, the bus is here"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "7660e693",
"en_raw": "Well then"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "bf7e5d2c",
"en_raw": "This river somehow"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "1f977987",
"en_raw": "feels like the border between city and country"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "ee6e1b8b",
"en_raw": "Ah, I want to go"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "67795e9d",
"en_raw": "over to that side too"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "c4c0f898",
"en_raw": "That old woman isn't here"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "cb0b6fba",
"en_raw": "Wait / Don't  She wouldn't come every day..."
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "e2d4d8af",
"en_raw": "...It's not like we have other leads"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "90aec621",
"en_raw": "...Looks like we came too late"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "ebe125c9",
"en_raw": "Well, well, we meet again"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "ebc40775",
"en_raw": "Um, around here, is there"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "b327cbc7",
"en_raw": "a place for Hanako-san's grave?"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "bb7c65f5",
"en_raw": "I doubt there is, but?"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "c42a6e16",
"en_raw": "That story again"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "fb2d1ca4",
"en_raw": "Well, Hanako-san"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "c6efc158",
"en_raw": "what kind of girl was she"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "76cd8c1f",
"en_raw": "Um, a little girl, I think"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "80d6af76",
"en_raw": "She's a yokai like that"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "b3edf3ec",
"en_raw": "Oh, oh, you mean the Hime Grove"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "e98420da",
"en_raw": "Oh dear, you"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "894af561",
"en_raw": "The Hime Grove isn't a grave"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "ec771cba",
"en_raw": "Well, it might be"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "ed40a00e",
"en_raw": "a little similar"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "4d38c0bb",
"en_raw": "...Does it really exist?"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "20b49443",
"en_raw": "See, if you turn before"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "b830034c",
"en_raw": "the big hospital there"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "56b02493",
"en_raw": "there are houses on Furumachi Street"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "a41d8931",
"en_raw": "and turning at the crossroads toward the river"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "82c7e1f2",
"en_raw": "it's the Hime Grove"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "756d5506",
"en_raw": "...Hime-no-Mori?"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "8ceb1922",
"en_raw": "Is that the name of the place?"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "8225b59d",
"en_raw": "Long ago, before I was born"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "89ba361c",
"en_raw": "a very, very old story"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "33ed6f12",
"en_raw": "You see, this river"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "452af943",
"en_raw": "now has a fine bridge"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "8c18a01d",
"en_raw": "...A monorail?"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "9403fb69",
"en_raw": "They even say they'll run"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "95ac8a98",
"en_raw": "such a thing, but"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "893231eb",
"en_raw": "Long, long ago"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "536b5c0e",
"en_raw": "it often flooded, apparently"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "b8eda5f9",
"en_raw": "You understand?"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "f87125cc",
"en_raw": "When it rained"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "f6f41b9a",
"en_raw": "the river water washed away fields and houses"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "678699ce",
"en_raw": "So they built"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "6dbc377f",
"en_raw": "reinforcements around the river"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "2bb5161d",
"en_raw": "but it didn't go well"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "548ea64c",
"en_raw": "and in the end, every year"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "dfd33f76",
"en_raw": "the water overflowed"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "55d2da63",
"en_raw": "The Hime Grove is"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "38f6b8ec",
"en_raw": "a shrine enshrining"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "494e9b1f",
"en_raw": "a little girl"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "a2ed453d",
"en_raw": "It's a story I often heard"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "97c70c0c",
"en_raw": "as a child"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "540767a6",
"en_raw": "It's a frightening"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "62aad48e",
"en_raw": "and sad story"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "f1ddac9b",
"en_raw": "It's also known as"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "57549993",
"en_raw": "human sacrifice"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "aff32d3d",
"en_raw": "To calm the river"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "08da13b8",
"en_raw": "along with various offerings"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "cc1052d5",
"en_raw": "one small, lovely girl"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "e419cf3f",
"en_raw": "to the bottom of the water..."
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "a371aafc",
"en_raw": "People of old did terrible things"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "cb887e6f",
"en_raw": "But strangely, since then"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "7e33c714",
"en_raw": "the river never flooded, they say"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "560b5b6e",
"en_raw": "So out of gratitude to the girl"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "a457620f",
"en_raw": "they built a shrine"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "3497a36b",
"en_raw": "That's the Hime Grove"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "f812b04d",
"en_raw": "Um, I"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "4efa027e",
"en_raw": "am in a bit of a hurry"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "8b5dac62",
"en_raw": "I'm meeting a friend"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "4f5a59f5",
"en_raw": "at that place"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "a76f8ab6",
"en_raw": "Could you tell me the location"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "97497771",
"en_raw": "briefly once more?"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "29a7cc12",
"en_raw": "If you turn left before the big hospital"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "56b02493",
"en_raw": "there are houses on Furumachi Street"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "a41d8931",
"en_raw": "and turning at the crossroads toward the river"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "82c7e1f2",
"en_raw": "it's the Hime Grove"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "ebd2ccab",
"en_raw": "Thank you very much"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "7660e693",
"en_raw": "Well then"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "ed99d5d3",
"en_raw": "I don't know the road ahead..."
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "b5bb2ada",
"en_raw": "For a walk, this is"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "e7d20466",
"en_raw": "a bit too far"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "c0e859da",
"en_raw": "If we go somewhere unfamiliar"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "c1f8d9b5",
"en_raw": "we won't be able to get home"
}
]
}